    {
      "source": "An <a href=\"IdGenerator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.util\"><code>IdGenerator</code></a> that uses <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/security/SecureRandom.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.security\"><code>SecureRandom</code></a> for the initial seed and\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Random.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Random</code></a> thereafter, instead of calling <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/UUID.html#randomUUID()\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>UUID.randomUUID()</code></a> every\ntime as <a href=\"JdkIdGenerator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.util\"><code>JdkIdGenerator</code></a> does.\nThis provides a better balance between securely random ids and performance.",
      "translation": "一个使用 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/security/SecureRandom.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.security\"><code>SecureRandom</code></a>` 作为初始种子，并在之后使用 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Random.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Random</code></a>` 的 `<a href=\"IdGenerator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.util\"><code>IdGenerator</code></a>`，而不是像 `<a href=\"JdkIdGenerator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.util\"><code>JdkIdGenerator</code></a>` 那样每次都调用 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/UUID.html#randomUUID()\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>UUID.randomUUID()</code></a>`。这提供了更安全随机 ID 与性能之间更好的平衡。",
      "count": 2
